DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
26466::$$$message_0195_0000_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26467::$$$message_0195_0000_0001$$$::I don't really feel like it, but I should at least ask once.[lr]::
26468::$$$message_0195_0000_0002$$$::What does Saber think of the resumed Holy Grail War?[lr]::
26469::$$$message_0195_0000_0003$$$::I remind myself to stay as levelheaded as possible and call to her beyond the sliding door.::
26470::$$$message_0195_0001_0000$$$::"You want to know what I think of our current situation?"[lr]::
26471::$$$message_0195_0001_0001$$$::"Yeah. We haven't sat down and had a proper talk about it yet. I wanted to get your take on this."::
26472::$$$message_0195_0002_0000$$$::"I don't mind that, but...[lr]::
26473::$$$message_0195_0002_0001$$$::...I wonder if speaking to me will help you gain any insights. I hope it does."::
26474::$$$message_0195_0003_0000$$$::"It doesn't need to help. I just wanted to talk to you today.[lr]::
26475::$$$message_0195_0003_0001$$$::Not to gain any special insights. I just want to know what you think."::
26476::$$$message_0195_0004_0000$$$::"What I think, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]then?"[lr]::
26477::$$$message_0195_0004_0001$$$::"Yeah. If you think there's something wrong with our direction, that's fine too.[lr]::
26478::$$$message_0195_0004_0002$$$::I want to ask what you think about this situation, what's strange about it to you, and what you want to do next."::
26479::$$$message_0195_0005_0000$$$::It's quiet for a moment.[lr]::
26480::$$$message_0195_0005_0001$$$::Saber seems to be organizing her thoughts without thinking too deeply.[lr]::
26481::$$$message_0195_0005_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
26482::$$$message_0195_0005_0003$$$::I start to feel anxious during the pause.[lr]::
26483::$$$message_0195_0005_0004$$$::I wonder if she'll say something I didn't even realize.::
26484::$$$message_0195_0006_0000$$$::"...Well, I don't know what has restarted the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
26485::$$$message_0195_0006_0001$$$::However, we must win it if it has resumed. I will not permit my Master to fail."[lr]::
26486::$$$message_0195_0006_0002$$$::"Gah. That takes me back."::
26487::$$$message_0195_0007_0000$$$::"Yes, I mean it as I did before. I made a wish for your absolute victory."[lr]::
26488::$$$message_0195_0007_0001$$$::Really? I'd say that just now felt more like a pep talk than a wish. From a bystander's point of view, it might even have seemed like a threat.::
26489::$$$message_0195_0008_0000$$$::"That is all I think. If nothing is amiss, we can continue to live this way. If someone bares their fangs at us, then we will strike them down.[lr]::
26490::$$$message_0195_0008_0001$$$::If we Servants are calamities by nature, I will bring disaster down on our enemies.[lr]::
26491::$$$message_0195_0008_0002$$$::I have the strength to protect all that I desire after all, just like you once described."::
26492::$$$message_0195_0009_0000$$$::So that's what Saber thinks.[lr]::
26493::$$$message_0195_0009_0001$$$::She wants to protect our life together, like I do.[lr]::
26494::$$$message_0195_0009_0002$$$::I'm incredibly happy to hear that, but a fundamental question still springs to mind.::
26495::$$$message_0195_0010_0000$$$::"Yeah. I agree with that direction.[lr]::
26496::$$$message_0195_0010_0001$$$::But Saber, do you think this situation is correct?"[lr]::
26497::$$$message_0195_0010_0002$$$::"Huh...? Is that not obvious?[lr]::
26498::$$$message_0195_0010_0003$$$::Things are unpredictable now that the war has resumed."::
26499::$$$message_0195_0011_0000$$$::"Yeah. We'd be in trouble if everyone wanted to fight like half a year ago. Well, without an actual Holy Grail to fight over, it won't happen."[lr]::
26500::$$$message_0195_0011_0001$$$::Still...[lr]::
26501::$$$message_0195_0011_0002$$$::I wanted to hear Saber's clear view on right and wrong.::
26502::$$$message_0195_0012_0000$$$::"I see. We destroyed the Holy Grail. I believe that was the right choice.[lr]::
26503::$$$message_0195_0012_0001$$$::...I won't forget that last night, when we climbed the stone steps together."::
26504::$$$message_0195_0013_0000$$$::"Yeah. We got split up after that, but we regrouped in the end, I think.[lr]::
26505::$$$message_0195_0013_0001$$$::It was a hard fight for both of us."::
26506::$$$message_0195_0014_0000$$$::"Yes. I fought the King of Heroes, while you fought the priest.[lr]::
26507::$$$message_0195_0014_0001$$$::Then I destroyed the Holy Grail with the aid of Rin's Command Spell."::
26508::$$$message_0195_0015_0000$$$::That's how the war was settled half a year ago.[lr]::
26509::$$$message_0195_0015_0001$$$::I fought alongside Saber during her time in Fuyuki. It's probably the only way things could have ended.::
26510::$$$message_0195_0016_0000$$$::"Shirou? What's wrong? You're making a curious expression.[lr]::
26511::$$$message_0195_0016_0001$$$::Do you think it's strange that the Servants won't fight unless the Holy Grail exists?"::
26512::$$$message_0195_0017_0000$$$::"Huh? No, that makes sense to me.[lr]::
26513::$$$message_0195_0017_0001$$$::Well, we still need to scout them out and figure out if they're up to anything dangerous."::
26514::$$$message_0195_0018_0000$$$::I've confirmed what Saber thinks.[lr]::
26515::$$$message_0195_0018_0001$$$::Now I just need to do the same for the other Servants as soon as I can.::
26516::$$$message_0195_0019_0000$$$::"Shirou? What's wrong? Do you need to use the toilet?"[lr]::
26517::$$$message_0195_0019_0001$$$::"No, I got to talk to you, so I should rest up tonight.[lr]::
26518::$$$message_0195_0019_0002$$$::Thanks for your time."::
26519::$$$message_0195_0020_0000$$$::"Ah...yes. Good night, Shirou... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服07a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服07a(中)]We still have time, but you must be tired."[lr]::
26520::$$$message_0195_0020_0001$$$::"Yeah. Good night, Saber."::
26521::$$$message_0195_0021_0000$$$::We exchange our farewells, and I close the door.[lr]::
26522::$$$message_0195_0021_0001$$$::It's dark outside.[lr]::
26523::$$$message_0195_0021_0002$$$::I gaze up at the ominously shaped moon through my window.[lr]::
26524::$$$message_0195_0021_0003$$$::"...Well, I'm glad that all worked out for me."::
26525::$$$message_0195_0022_0000$$$::Absently, I speak as if I'm inviting the moon here. I didn't learn anything new, but the time spent was worth it.[lr]::
26526::$$$message_0195_0022_0001$$$::Now, I'll go back to my room and sleep.::
926489::$$$message_9195_0008_0000$$$::"That is all I think. If nothing is amiss, we can continue to live this way. If someone bares their fangs at us, then we will strike them down."[r],���